  "notes": "{録音|ろくおん} means audio recording — both the act of recording sound and the recorded material itself. Composed of {録|ろく} (record) + {音|おん} (sound).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {録音|ろくおん}する: to record audio\n- {録音|ろくおん}を{再生|さいせい}する: to play back a recording\n- {録音|ろくおん}を{聞|き}く: to listen to a recording\n- {録音|ろくおん}{機能|きのう}: recording function/feature\n- {録音|ろくおん}{禁止|きんし}: recording prohibited\n\nCONTRAST:\n- {録音|ろくおん}: audio only\n- {録画|ろくが}: video recording\n- {収録|しゅうろく}: recording (for broadcast/publication)\n- レコーディング: recording (music industry term)",
